Subject: [PATCH 1172/3799] soh: rename func_80ABF28C ->
 EnOkarinaTag_WaitForFixedSong

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the idle for the types whose song is fixed by the type itself (Zora's River, the windmill, the Door of Time, the royal tomb); it starts the matching OCARINA_ACTION_CHECK when the player plays nearby.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Okarina_Tag/z_en_okarina_tag.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
